        <h1 class="profile-detail-name">Frederick the Great</h1>
        <div class="info-stats" style="margin-top:10px;">
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Period</span><span class="info-stat-val">1712 CE – 1786 CE</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Born</span><span class="info-stat-val">24 January 1712, in the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/berlin">Berlin</a> Palace; son of Crown Prince Frederick William of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/kingdom-of-prussia">Prussia</a> and Sophia Dorothea of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/hanover">Hanover</a>, of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/house-of-hohenzollern">House of Hohenzollern</a></span></div>
